            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Self-Loathing"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, mental)\n\nA mitflit's self-loathing makes it easy to influence. It takes a \u20134 penalty to its Will DC against checks to Coerce, Demoralize, Make an Impression, and Request."
            },
            "id": "3639fdb0-63c6-4de1-834b-cedbb977d629",
